lems roof leaks or you're  plagued by cockroaches mice and bedbugs  because the cellars too cold now the  most of us will be moving into the new  house that's currently being assembled  by the business professionals their tiny  apartment isn't really suited to a  disabled person's needs but the most of  us won't only have a new home Alexandra  who is an artist and designer will have  a new job too the coastal tongue can 3/8  in the future I'll be working as a  consultant for única walls I have some  ideas about different ways that one can  build the facade to avoid well-trodden  designs and attract a more exclusive  clientele but not too complicated I  think they could make good use of the  individual components of the new house  are made in a factory in the country's  Northwest Alexandra Mustafa has come  here to see which facades the company  offers so far  each house is unique the design of the  Mustapha family's home also originated  on a computer here the most important  building material is timber the company  uses the leftover scraps for firewood  what you see behind me is the raw wood  that we import or we either buy from  Moldova we cut it to exact size for our  panels all the rest of the wood is used  to heat up this entire home each panel  consists of a wooden frame which is then  filled with polystyrene sheets it's a  plastic but it's unbeatable in terms of  weight and density then the panel is  sealed with fire proof and waterproof  sheeting a tree on volnek and his  colleagues from unique ax are keen to  pass on their expertise so they hold  regular lectures at Moldova's Technical  University the University which is  training up the engineers of tomorrow  has made energy supply and efficiency  one of its core themes the situation is  not that good right now because Moldova  depends only on one country in terms of  gas and  petrol on Russia and for us it's very  important to diversify such sources it's  day three on the construction site and  the house is standing now it's time to  fit the windows the basic construction  cost fifty thousand euros a part of that  was financed by donations from the  volunteer workers in two hours the keys  will be handed over the insulation and  waterproofing still have to be added to  the roof everyone is going hammer and  tongs to get it finished I think it's  totally cool that I can stay in Europe  and say okay I'm gonna work on this  project I know where my money is going  in the evening it's time for the big  moment the Mustafa family are given the  keys to their new home then it's time to  celebrate meanwhile the family can now  inspect their new rooms it's been such a  wonderful day  I feel great really great ever since I  met my husband we dreamed of one day  owning our own home now that dream is a  reality it's all a bit overwhelming just  super some of the team want to take part  in the next house building project too  and make another family happy  [Music]
 

